	{
		{"mwf"},
		{"text"},
		line=1634,
	},
	{
		{"mwf"},
		{"msgoff"},
		{"bg", del=2, lv=0, id=31, path=":bg/", file="black", time=1000, wait=500, sync=1},
		{"bgm", stop=1, [1]="", time=1500},
		{"excall", call=0, file="hat030230"},
		line=1634,
	},
	text={
		[1]={
			name={"name", name="???"},
			{
"“Onii-sama?”",
			},
		},
		[2]={
			name={"name", name="???"},
			{
"“Are you still asleep?”",
			},
		},
		[3]={
			{
"A gentle shaking stirs my body.",
			},
		},
		[4]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Mm...”",
			},
		},
		[5]={
			name={"name", name="???"},
			{
"“Good morning, Onii-sama.”",
			},
		},
		[6]={
			{
"A near and dear face peers down at me.",
			},
		},
		[7]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Kanami...?”",
			},
		},
		[8]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Yes.”",
			},
		},
		[9]={
			{
"How many years has it been since someone's woken me up like this?",
			},
		},
		[10]={
			{
"I must have fallen into a much deeper sleep than I thought.",
			},
		},
		[11]={
			{
"Ordinarily, I would have roused myself as soon as I sensed a nearby presence.",
			},
		},
		[12]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Hehehee, what a sleepyhead you are, Onii-sama.”",
			},
		},
		[13]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“What is it? Did I do anything strange?”",
			},
		},
		[14]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Take a look in the mirror.”",
			},
		},
		[15]={
			{
"Kanami gestures towards her own hair.",
			},
		},
		[16]={
			{
"I touch my own hair around where Kanami is pointing at hers.",
			},
		},
		[17]={
			{
"Seems like I have an incredible case of bedhead.",
			},
		},
		[18]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“How fare your injuries?”",
			},
		},
		[19]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“It's no big deal. I'm just fine.”",
			},
		},
		[20]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“You always have been remarkably resilient.”",
			},
		},
		[21]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Even the Myougikan used to say that they'd never seen a warrior who could take such a beating as you.”",
			},
		},
		[22]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“So my body's always been like this, huh?”",
			},
		},
		[23]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Just the other day, even the Republican soldiers couldn't help but find it off-putting.”",
			},
		},
		[24]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Your Kanami has never once been put off by you.”",
			},
		},
		[25]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“She has always taken great pride in her Onii-sama.”",
			},
		},
		[26]={
			{
"Kanami puffs out her chest like a parent bragging about their child.",
			},
		},
		[27]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Do you think you can manage some breakfast?”",
			},
		},
		[28]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Yeah, of course.”",
			},
		},
		[29]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Then I shall prepare it straight away. Please do go wash your face in the meantime.”",
			},
		},
		[30]={
			{
"Once I finish dressing myself, the sitting room is filled with the aroma of freshly prepared food.",
			},
		},
		[31]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Ahh, this smell... Tofu miso soup?”",
			},
		},
		[32]={
			{
"My mouth immediately begins to water.",
			},
		},
		[33]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Yes. It's always been your favorite, after all.”",
			},
		},
		[34]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“You may not remember, but you once said that you could not properly start your day until you've had it in the morning.”",
			},
		},
		[35]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I started drooling as soon as I smelled it.”",
			},
		},
		[36]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“It looks like my body still remembers.”",
			},
		},
		[37]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Hehee, that makes me happy.”",
			},
		},
		[38]={
			{
"I survey the dishes lined up on the table.",
			},
		},
		[39]={
			{
"A fillet of mackerel, rolled omelettes, tofu miso soup, and pickled vegetables─as standard of an Imperial breakfast as they come.",
			},
		},
		[40]={
			{
"It's everything that I could have wanted.",
			},
		},
		[41]={
			{
"The best breakfast in the world doesn't require anything fancy, so long as it has a taste so familiar that you can feel it in your bones.",
			},
		},
		[42]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“What a wonderful breakfast. You didn't have to do all this, Kanami.”",
			},
		},
		[43]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“No, your Kanami has always dreamed of being able to cook for you.”",
			},
		},
		[44]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“My skills are a far cry from Mother's, but I hope you will still eat your fill.”",
			},
		},
		[45]={
			{
"As soon as I sit down, Kanami serves me a heaping bowl of rice.",
			},
		},
		[46]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“What about you?”",
			},
		},
		[47]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“I will eat after you are finished.”",
			},
		},
		[48]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Let's eat together.”",
			},
		},
		[49]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“But...”",
			},
		},
		[50]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Don't be shy.”",
			},
		},
		[51]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Th-Then, if I may be so bold...”",
			},
		},
		[52]={
			{
"Kanami eagerly sits down across from me, unable to hide her happiness.",
			},
		},
		[53]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“It's been three years, huh?”",
			},
		},
		[54]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“That it has.”",
			},
		},
		[55]={
			{
"Kanami gazes at me with a warm smile.",
			},
		},
		[56]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You must have gone through a whole lot.”",
			},
		},
		[57]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“But all of that is in the past now.”",
			},
		},
		[58]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Your Kanami has never been happier.”",
			},
		},
		[59]={
			{
"Ever since the war ended, the both of us have endured many trials and tribulations.",
			},
		},
		[60]={
			{
"But there's no need for us to live in the past any longer.",
			},
		},
		[61]={
			{
"And so, let all the suffering we went through become a distant memory, drifting away to nothingness along with the scent of this breakfast.",
			},
		},
		[62]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Thanks again for cooking, Kanami.”",
			},
		},
		[63]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“It's my pleasure.”",
			},
		},
		[64]={
			{
"I start by taking a sip of the soup.",
			},
		},
		[65]={
			{
"The fragrant aroma of the scallions and miso fills my nose.",
			},
		},
		[66]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Ah...”",
			},
		},
		[67]={
			{
"I involuntarily let out a contented sigh.",
			},
		},
		[68]={
			{
"I would ordinarily move on to my rice, but I just can't get enough.",
			},
		},
		[69]={
			{
"Lost in fond recollection, I unthinkingly finish my entire bowl.",
			},
		},
		[70]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Hehee, your miso soup is not going to go anywhere.”",
			},
		},
		[71]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Would you like another serving?”",
			},
		},
		[72]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Please.”",
			},
		},
		[73]={
			{
"Kanami subtly dabs at the corners of her eyes with her fingers before she reaches out to take the bowl I offer her.",
			},
		},
		[74]={
			{
"I'll pretend I didn't see anything.",
			},
		},
		[75]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Did I really get to eat this every single morning?”",
			},
		},
		[76]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I must have lived a very blessed life.”",
			},
		},
		[77]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Looking back now, those were most precious times indeed.”",
			},
		},
		[78]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“It is often said, but you truly do not recognize the happiness that you had until you lose it.”",
			},
		},
		[79]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“...Ah, that's right. You asked for a second serving, did you not?”",
			},
		},
		[80]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Onii-sama, please do try the other dishes in the meantime.”",
			},
		},
		[81]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“No need to rush. Don't spill it now.”",
			},
		},
		[82]={
			{
"I watch Kanami all the while as she scampers off towards the kitchen.",
			},
		},
		[83]={
			{
"Only then do I notice that I've been smiling this whole time.",
			},
		},
		[84]={
			{
"I'm sure that this isn't the first time I've had this look on my face eating breakfast with my family.",
			},
		},
		[85]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Sure smells real nice in here.”",
			},
		},
		[86]={
			{
"Akari pokes her head into the room.",
			},
		},
		[87]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Why, Miyaguni-sama, good morning.”",
			},
		},
		[88]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Morning.”",
			},
		},
		[89]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Sorry for interrupting. The door was wide open.”",
			},
		},
		[90]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“If it pleases you, would you care to join us for breakfast?”",
			},
		},
		[91]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“I would be glad to prepare a serving for you.”",
			},
		},
		[92]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Thanks, but I'll pass.”",
			},
		},
		[93]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You finally get to spend some quality time alone together,\ndon't you? I wouldn't dare get in the way of that.”",
			},
		},
		[94]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“You need not concern yourself over that...”",
			},
		},
		[95]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“It's fine, it's fine. Don't worry about it.”",
			},
		},
		[96]={
			{
"Akari hastily waves her hands.",
			},
		},
		[97]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I'm just glad the two of you are safe and sound. Let's catch up over tea some other time.”",
			},
		},
		[98]={
			{
"With that, Akari promptly leaves us alone again.",
			},
		},
		[99]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“It seems she was very worried for our sake.”",
			},
		},
		[100]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'm thankful to have her as my lord.”",
			},
		},
		[101]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“How much does Miyaguni-sama know about what happened?”",
			},
		},
		[102]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I gave her the gist of things.”",
			},
		},
		[103]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Including our deal with Elsa, of course.”",
			},
		},
		[104]={
			{
"Kanami's expression stiffens at this.",
			},
		},
		[105]={
			{
"Kanami and Elsa's vision of the Empire doesn't align with\nAkari's.",
			},
		},
		[106]={
			{
"If Akari refuses to accept it, then as her vassal, I won't be able to support Kanami either.",
			},
		},
		[107]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You said you'd win Akari over, right?”",
			},
		},
		[108]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Yes, I absolutely intend to.”",
			},
		},
		[109]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“This will be the most important battle of Tokita Kanami's life.”",
			},
		},
		[110]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“I'll have to eat a big breakfast and work up my courage before I face her!”",
			},
		},
		[111]={
			{
"After breakfast, Kanami insists on helping with our work at Koujiya Flowers.",
			},
		},
		[112]={
			{
"She says it's her way to repay the manager for his hospitality.",
			},
		},
		[113]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Welcome!”",
			},
		},
		[114]={
			{
"The flower shop finds itself with a very busy bee in its midst.",
			},
		},
		[115]={
			{
"Despite her slender arms, Kanami doesn't shrink from any task requiring heavy lifting or physical labor.",
			},
		},
		[116]={
			{
"Her reserved and modest smile is very well suited for a store where flowers are the star of the show.",
			},
		},
		[117]={
			{
"The customers, too, are all delighted to introduce themselves to the lovely new hire.",
			},
		},
		[118]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“It is very nice to work up a sweat like this.”",
			},
		},
		[119]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“I might not look like it, but I used to do the chores around the house from dawn to dusk.”",
			},
		},
		[120]={
			{
"Kanami facetiously flexes her biceps at me.",
			},
		},
		[121]={
			{
"Male warriors generally do very little of the housework.",
			},
		},
		[122]={
			{
"It's probably no exaggeration for her to say that she really did work from dawn to dusk.",
			},
		},
		[123]={
			{
"Watching her work like this, without so much as a care in the world, I can't help but hope against hope for this time to last just a little longer.",
			},
		},
		[124]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“These flowers? Absolutely!”",
			},
		},
		[125]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Kanami, mind wrapping these up?”",
			},
		},
		[126]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“A fine choice, ma'am. I'll have them prepared right away.”",
			},
		},
		[127]={
			{
"Akari is also unusually fired up today.",
			},
		},
		[128]={
			{
"She's doing everything she can to make Kanami's precious day as enjoyable as it can be.",
			},
		},
		[129]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“Today is going to go down in Koujiya Flowers' history!”",
			},
		},
		[130]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“I'd love to be on the other side of the counter myself.”",
			},
		},
		[131]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“We do have two Empresses working here, after all.”",
			},
		},
		[132]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“Oh, thank Oomikami that I was able to live long enough to see this day.”",
			},
		},
		[133]={
			{
"The manager gazes at the two with a fond smile on his face.",
			},
		},
		[134]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You aren't nearly old enough yet to be saying stuff like that.”",
			},
		},
		[135]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“I suppose so.”",
			},
		},
		[136]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“I've just been feeling a little blue, but I really need to get myself together.”",
			},
		},
		[137]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Did you get turned down by some woman?”",
			},
		},
		[138]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“Hahaha! Not quite, but you're not far off either.”",
			},
		},
		[139]={
			{
"The manager laughs jokingly.",
			},
		},
		[140]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Mr. Manager, we've run out of spare change over here.”",
			},
		},
		[141]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“Soujin-kun, sorry, but can I ask you to go break a few bills?”",
			},
		},
		[142]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Yep, I'm on it.”",
			},
		},
		[143]={
			{
"A little past three of the clock, Kanami and I go shopping for dinner ingredients.",
			},
		},
		[144]={
			{
"It's just a simple shopping trip, but Kanami is wearing a tense look on her face as she walks beside me.",
			},
		},
		[145]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“What's wrong?”",
			},
		},
		[146]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“N-Nothing at all.”",
			},
		},
		[147]={
			{
"So she says, but it seems she can't help but be wary of all the eyes around us.",
			},
		},
		[148]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Don't worry. Nobody'll recognize it's you wearing clothes like those.”",
			},
		},
		[149]={
			{
"Hotori prepared this outfit for Kanami beforehand.",
			},
		},
		[150]={
			{
"It's a deliberately modest outfit that wouldn't give passersby any idea that she's actually the Empress.",
			},
		},
		[151]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Th-That is not what I mean...”",
			},
		},
		[152]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Onii-sama, am I not revealing too much of my legs?”",
			},
		},
		[153]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Being surrounded by people like this, I suddenly feel terribly self-conscious...”",
			},
		},
		[154]={
			{
"Kanami curls up into herself, her face flushed bright red.",
			},
		},
		[155]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I don't think it's any different from what you wear as Empress.”",
			},
		},
		[156]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“In that outfit, you can practically see your underwear through the sides.”",
			},
		},
		[157]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Onii-sama! Please, mind the way you say things...”",
			},
		},
		[158]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Hotori wears clothes like this all the time. It's nothing to get worried about.”",
			},
		},
		[159]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Hotori-chan can pull it off only because she has such pretty legs.”",
			},
		},
		[160]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“In that case, what do you have to worry about?”",
			},
		},
		[161]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Aaahh, awawawa...”",
			},
		},
		[162]={
			{
"She blushes and shrinks into herself even more.",
			},
		},
		[163]={
			{
"How adorable.",
			},
		},
		[164]={
			{
"By this time tomorrow, this ordinary girl will be standing before the people as their Empress.",
			},
		},
		[165]={
			{
"The more time we spend together, the greater the pain in my heart grows.",
			},
		},
		[166]={
			{
"But no matter what, I at least want to leave her with some fond memories of today.",
			},
		},
		[167]={
			{
"Memories she can hold tight and treasure for the rest of her life.",
			},
		},
		[168]={
			{
"Suddenly, I look beside me to find Kanami staring up at a bird soaring through the sky.",
			},
		},
		[169]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Kanami, wanna go for a little flight?”",
			},
		},
		[170]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“E-Excuse me?”",
			},
		},
		[171]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“A flight. Through the sky.”",
			},
		},
		[172]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Th-The sky, you say?”",
			},
		},
		[173]={
			{
"She's taken completely aback.",
			},
		},
		[174]={
			{
"I see. I must have been totally off the mark.",
			},
		},
		[175]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“You come up with the strangest ideas at times.”",
			},
		},
		[176]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“But your Kanami would go anywhere at all if it's with you, Onii-sama.”",
			},
		},
		[177]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“All right.”",
			},
		},
		[178]={
			{
"I wrap my hands around Kanami's waist.",
			},
		},
		[179]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Huh?”",
			},
		},
		[180]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“H-Hweeeeeh?!”",
			},
		},
		[181]={
			{
"I leap onto a nearby rooftop in a single breath.",
			},
		},
		[182]={
			{
"Then, I bound from one high-rise to the next.",
			},
		},
		[183]={
			{
"The wind flows though my hair as I soar through the sky.",
			},
		},
		[184]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Kanami, try opening your eyes.”",
			},
		},
		[185]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“B-But...”",
			},
		},
		[186]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You're safe with me.”",
			},
		},
		[187]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“R-Right.”",
			},
		},
		[188]={
			{
"Cradled in my arms, Kanami timidly blinks open her eyes.",
			},
		},
		[189]={
			{
"The next moment, her face shines as brightly as the sun in the clear sky.",
			},
		},
		[190]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“What a magnificent view!”",
			},
		},
		[191]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“I have never seen a sight such as this before!”",
			},
		},
		[192]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“It's a vista reserved only for warriors.”",
			},
		},
		[193]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“So this is Tenkyo...”",
			},
		},
		[194]={
			{
"Kanami murmurs to herself as she clings tightly to me.",
			},
		},
		[195]={
			{
"Just a single, thin layer of clothes separates our bodies.",
			},
		},
		[196]={
			{
"And through it, I can sense the subdued susurration of her beating heart.",
			},
		},
		[197]={
			{
"How helplessly near and dear it is, the whisper of her heartbeat.",
			},
		},
		[198]={
			{
"Leaping across the rooftops, I savor the sensation a while longer before finally alighting atop the tallest building in Tenkyo.",
			},
		},
		[199]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Not scared anymore?”",
			},
		},
		[200]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“No, not at all.”",
			},
		},
		[201]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“You really did whisk me away, just like the dashing protagonist in a romance novel.”",
			},
		},
		[202]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“I am the happiest girl in the world.”",
			},
		},
		[203]={
			{
"Kanami nuzzles her head against my chest.",
			},
		},
		[204]={
			{
"I'm glad she's happy.",
			},
		},
		[205]={
			{
"Does this mean I've kept that promise I made her?",
			},
		},
		[206]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Being like this reminds me of the past.”",
			},
		},
		[207]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“That time I was stung by the jellyfish at the beach, you held me just like this.”",
			},
		},
		[208]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Then there was that time a stray dog was about to bite me, and also that time a cicada ambushed me on the roadside...”",
			},
		},
		[209]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Sounds like you spent quite some time in my arms.”",
			},
		},
		[210]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“That is why your Kanami did not wish to grow any taller.”",
			},
		},
		[211]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“I was concerned you might stop holding me if I was too heavy.”",
			},
		},
		[212]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“As if. I'd be a failure as a warrior if I couldn't even carry my baby sister.”",
			},
		},
		[213]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Heh, hehehehee...”",
			},
		},
		[214]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“What did I say that was so funny?”",
			},
		},
		[215]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Nothing. It just reminded me.”",
			},
		},
		[216]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“As a matter of fact, you once said the exact same thing to me in the past.”",
			},
		},
		[217]={
			{
"Kanami recounts her recollection to me.",
			},
		},
		[218]={
			{
"It was back before the war, when I still served as an assistant instructor at the Myougikan.",
			},
		},
		[219]={
			{
"At that time, watching me train was Kanami's greatest joy.",
			},
		},
		[220]={
			{
"However, since Father forbade her from interfering with the warriors' training, she would sneak out of the house and go to the Myougikan in secret.",
			},
		},
		[221]={
			{
"But the dojo's windows were high off the ground.",
			},
		},
		[222]={
			{
"As Kanami was still small, she always stood on a wooden box to watch me train.",
			},
		},
		[223]={
			{
"But one day, the box collapsed under her, and Kanami injured herself.",
			},
		},
		[224]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“You were there to pick me up and carry me all the way home with my sprained leg.”",
			},
		},
		[225]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“When you did, you said the same thing you did just moments ago.”",
			},
		},
		[226]={
			{
"I may have lost my memories, but it seems like I haven't changed very much from the way I was.",
			},
		},
		[227]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Father must have been furious at you.”",
			},
		},
		[228]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Actually, you agreed to keep the source of my injury a secret and spared me from his wrath.”",
			},
		},
		[229]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Father's lectures were always terribly long, so I remember being grateful from the bottom of my heart.”",
			},
		},
		[230]={
			{
"Following that incident, Kanami managed to behave herself for a few days, but eventually, she couldn't take it anymore.",
			},
		},
		[231]={
			{
"However, she was met with an unexpected sight when she snuck out to the Myougikan.",
			},
		},
		[232]={
			{
"Right below her usual window was a rock perfect for climbing on.",
			},
		},
		[233]={
			{
"She realized immediately that I had placed it there.",
			},
		},
		[234]={
			{
"But not wanting me to coddle her forever, she decided to build herself a sturdy platform from which she could watch my training to her heart's content.",
			},
		},
		[235]={
			{
"What a real mystery she can be: at times meek and reserved, but at other times bold and daring.",
			},
		},
		[236]={
			{
"The one thing I know for certain is that when it comes to the subject of me, she could talk anyone's ear off.",
			},
		},
		[237]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“What were we even talking about in the first place?”",
			},
		},
		[238]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“The fact that when she is in your arms like this, your Kanami is truly the happiest girl in the world.”",
			},
		},
		[239]={
			{
"Once again, she lovingly nuzzles her head into my chest.",
			},
		},
		[240]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“If only your Kanami could claim this spot as hers forevermore.”",
			},
		},
		[241]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“But one day, you will hold someone else just like this, will you not?”",
			},
		},
		[242]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Hotori-chan, perhaps? Or Kotone-san? Or even the dark horse, Elsa-sama?”",
			},
		},
		[243]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Hey, now, what's all that for?”",
			},
		},
		[244]={
			{
"Kanami sticks her tongue out at me and turns to gaze upon the Tenkyo vista.",
			},
		},
		[245]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Ah, what a lovely view this is!”",
			},
		},
		[246]={
			{
"What a bald-faced attempt to change the subject.",
			},
		},
		[247]={
			{
"I'd always thought her too guileless for her own good, but it turns out she can be awfully cunning at times.",
			},
		},
		[248]={
			{
"Before the war, she must have had me wrapped around her little finger.",
			},
		},
		[249]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“The Imperial Palace looks so small from up here.”",
			},
		},
		[250]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“For the past three years, it felt like I was trapped in an endless labyrinth.”",
			},
		},
		[251]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You must have suffered a lot.”",
			},
		},
		[252]={
			{
"Kanami nods ever so slightly.",
			},
		},
		[253]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“My daily schedule was decided down to the minute, and not once was I able to speak freely.”",
			},
		},
		[254]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Being forced to live like that, I started forgetting who I really was.”",
			},
		},
		[255]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Harboring futile thoughts and desires and grievances all became too much for me, and I felt myself turning into a doll who lives just to get through each day.”",
			},
		},
		[256]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“That is why I wrote letters to you every single day.”",
			},
		},
		[257]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Being able to pour out all my feelings to you allowed me to be just a little bit stronger.”",
			},
		},
		[258]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Do you find a sister such as me unpleasant, perchance?”",
			},
		},
		[259]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Of course not.”",
			},
		},
		[260]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You did well to survive.”",
			},
		},
		[261]={
			{
"My hands full from holding her in my arms, the most I can do is to lay my cheek on top of her head.",
			},
		},
		[262]={
			{
"Kanami purrs contentedly like a cat being stroked by its owner.",
			},
		},
		[263]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Truthfully, I am terribly afraid of returning back to the Imperial Palace.”",
			},
		},
		[264]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“But seeing the world from up here has made me feel a little braver.”",
			},
		},
		[265]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“If I just remind myself that everything is only taking place in such a tiny building as that, I will be able to get through anything.”",
			},
		},
		[266]={
			{
"My chest aches hearing the tragic resolve in her voice.",
			},
		},
		[267]={
			{
"Kanami made this deal with Elsa just to protect me.",
			},
		},
		[268]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You'll still have to be Empress, but things'll be way different from when Okonogi was in power.”",
			},
		},
		[269]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'll ask Elsa to allow us to meet regularly.”",
			},
		},
		[270]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Yes, please do.”",
			},
		},
		[271]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“If Elsa-sama does not oblige once in a while, your Kanami just might lose her mind.”",
			},
		},
		[272]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Next time, I might not stop at merely revealing my identity, you know?”",
			},
		},
		[273]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Hahaha, you're scaring me.”",
			},
		},
		[274]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“I am a scary woman indeed, I'll have you know.”",
			},
		},
		[275]={
			{
"Kanami gleefully declares, wrapping her arms around me.",
			},
		},
		[276]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Achoo!”",
			},
		},
		[277]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Even though it is summer, I suppose the wind can get rather chilly up here.”",
			},
		},
		[278]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Let's call our little excursion here, then.”",
			},
		},
		[279]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Whatever you say, Onii-sama.”",
			},
		},
		[280]={
			{
"After finishing our dinner, Kanami, Akari, and I relax over tea.",
			},
		},
		[281]={
			{
"Elsa will be here to pick up Kanami come tomorrow morning.",
			},
		},
		[282]={
			{
"It's about time for us to have a very important conversation.",
			},
		},
		[283]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Miyaguni-sama, I would like to speak with you.”",
			},
		},
		[284]={
			{
"One step ahead of me, Kanami meaningfully sets her teacup down.",
			},
		},
		[285]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“I have no words with which to apologize for all the trouble I have caused you.”",
			},
		},
		[286]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“I went ahead and scuttled Operation Bellflower all on my own.”",
			},
		},
		[287]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“On top of that, I unilaterally went and made a deal with Elsa-sama regarding the future of the Empire.”",
			},
		},
		[288]={
			{
"Starting tomorrow, Kanami will serve as Empress under\nElsa's rule.",
			},
		},
		[289]={
			{
"All for the sake of realizing Elsa's ideal of bringing democracy to the Empire.",
			},
		},
		[290]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I've already said this before, but so long as the Empire is at peace, I have no attachments to my own status.”",
			},
		},
		[291]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“If it's the will of the people, I would even welcome the abolition of the Imperial institution.”",
			},
		},
		[292]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“All I'll ask is this.”",
			},
		},
		[293]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Kanami... Or rather, Your Majesty.”",
			},
		},
		[294]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“As the one who stands atop the Empire, what are your intentions for this country?”",
			},
		},
		[295]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Huh?”",
			},
		},
		[296]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“What do you want the Empire to become?”",
			},
		},
		[297]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“I am now nothing more than Elsa-sama's puppet.”",
			},
		},
		[298]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“I shall only act as per her dictates.”",
			},
		},
		[299]={
			{
"Akari coolly sips at her tea without offering any reply.",
			},
		},
		[300]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Then I suppose I'll have to strike you down.”",
			},
		},
		[301]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“You have nothing to worry about.”",
			},
		},
		[302]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Elsa-sama will not lead the Empire astray.”",
			},
		},
		[303]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“And what if Elsa changes her mind?”",
			},
		},
		[304]={
			{
"The two stare silently at each other.",
			},
		},
		[305]={
			{
"Akari is testing whether even as Elsa's puppet, Kanami has the resolve demanded of an Empress.",
			},
		},
		[306]={
			{
"She refuses to accept an Empress who lacks the resolve needed to carry the weight of the country on her shoulders.",
			},
		},
		[307]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“It matters not to me, so long as Onii-sama is safe and sound.”",
			},
		},
		[308]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You would embroil the entire Empire in your own selfish whims?”",
			},
		},
		[309]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“That has nothing to do with this.”",
			},
		},
		[310]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“If you cannot abide by the path that I have chosen, then strike me down, here and now.”",
			},
		},
		[311]={
			{
"Seeing that Kanami will not back down, Akari lets out a heavy sigh.",
			},
		},
		[312]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Guess I have to hold her guardian accountable instead...”",
			},
		},
		[313]={
			{
"Akari turns to look at me.",
			},
		},
		[314]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Soujin, why, pray tell, didn't you stop her from making that deal with Elsa?”",
			},
		},
		[315]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You know full well that Kanami couldn't care less what happens to the Empire so long as her Onii-sama is safe.”",
			},
		},
		[316]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“And yet, you still didn't stop her. Wouldn't you say that makes you just as guilty as she is?”",
			},
		},
		[317]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I believed what Elsa said.”",
			},
		},
		[318]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I didn't think she would lead the Empire down the wrong path.”",
			},
		},
		[319]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Can you still say that with a straight face even after rationally thinking about it?”",
			},
		},
		[320]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Mh...”",
			},
		},
		[321]={
			{
"I wouldn't be able to say that I completely trust her.",
			},
		},
		[322]={
			{
"Until just a few days ago, I was convinced that Elsa would eventually betray us.",
			},
		},
		[323]={
			{
"On top of that, Kanami said she was trying to save me from her when she revealed her identity.",
			},
		},
		[324]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Well, either way, it's too late for you to take your deal back now.”",
			},
		},
		[325]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Besides, it's possible that Elsa really does have the best interests of the Empire in mind.”",
			},
		},
		[326]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Kanami and I are willing to bet on that.”",
			},
		},
		[327]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Very well then.”",
			},
		},
		[328]={
			{
"Akari grins at me with a theatrical nod.",
			},
		},
		[329]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“If that's the case, Soujin, you're naturally gonna need to take responsibility if you lose that bet.”",
			},
		},
		[330]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“That's my condition for stepping aside.”",
			},
		},
		[331]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Onii-sama has nothing to do with this!”",
			},
		},
		[332]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Since you've got nothing but Onii-sama on the brain, the responsibility naturally falls upon your guardian instead.”",
			},
		},
		[333]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“After all, he ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"did",
{"/font"},
" just stand by and watch his own sister sell her country down the river, didn't he?”",
			},
		},
		[334]={
			{
"Akari shows me a meaningful look.",
			},
		},
		[335]={
			{
"Her provocative words seem to belie her true intentions.",
			},
		},
		[336]={
			{
"She's probably using me to try and set Kanami straight.",
			},
		},
		[337]={
			{
"If Kanami only moves for my sake, then Elsa will be able to easily manipulate her.",
			},
		},
		[338]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I accept your condition.”",
			},
		},
		[339]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“If Elsa would bring ruin to the Empire, I shall take all responsibility in Kanami's place.”",
			},
		},
		[340]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Good.”",
			},
		},
		[341]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Onii-sama, don't you go making decisions like these over my head!”",
			},
		},
		[342]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“This is a covenant between me and Akari. You have nothing to do with it.”",
			},
		},
		[343]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“I very much do!”",
			},
		},
		[344]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“I am the one who proposed the deal with Elsa-sama in the first place!”",
			},
		},
		[345]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Then you'll just have to make sure Elsa holds up her end of the bargain.”",
			},
		},
		[346]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“My life is in your hands.”",
			},
		},
		[347]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Nnh...”",
			},
		},
		[348]={
			{
"Kanami hangs her head with a sullen expression.",
			},
		},
		[349]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“The two of you are both terribly unfair.”",
			},
		},
		[350]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Kanami.”",
			},
		},
		[351]={
			{
"Akari takes Kanami's hands in her own.",
			},
		},
		[352]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I entrust you with the future of the Empire.”",
			},
		},
		[353]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“I am nothing but a craven impostor. I cannot hope to live up to such a grand task.”",
			},
		},
		[354]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You've done plenty already.”",
			},
		},
		[355]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You were the one who kept the people's hope alive all this time when I could do nothing for them.”",
			},
		},
		[356]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I'm sure even Soujin was just one of many people who took encouragement from your smiling face.”",
			},
		},
		[357]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“That goes without saying.”",
			},
		},
		[358]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“All the warriors in the Sworn Blades would swear our allegiance to you every single meeting.”",
			},
		},
		[359]={
			{
"Akari nods in agreement towards Kanami.",
			},
		},
		[360]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Regardless of lineage, you've been a splendid Empress.”",
			},
		},
		[361]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“All this time, I've been meaning to thank you for that.”",
			},
		},
		[362]={
			{
"Akari sits up straight and faces Kanami with all sincerity.",
			},
		},
		[363]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Kanami... Empress Hisui.”",
			},
		},
		[364]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“For ruling over the Empire when I was powerless to do so, you have my most sincere gratitude.”",
			},
		},
		[365]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I know that the people will be in very worthy hands moving forward.”",
			},
		},
		[366]={
			{
"So saying, Akari lowers her head to the floor.",
			},
		},
		[367]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“P-Please rise. It is unthinkable that the Imperial Princess should lower her head...”",
			},
		},
		[368]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“It's only natural to bow to the Empress, you know.”",
			},
		},
		[369]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“Nnh... Whatever am I to do...?”",
			},
		},
		[370]={
			{
"Kanami looks to me for assistance.",
			},
		},
		[371]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“This is the path you chose for yourself.”",
			},
		},
		[372]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'm counting on you to be a worthy Empress.”",
			},
		},
		[373]={
			name={"name", name="Kanami"},
			{
"“...I shall not disappoint you.”",
			},
		},
		[374]={
			{
"Kanami declares with a solemn bow.",
			},
		},
	},
	label={
	},
}
